model life04
  tally 1
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2025-01-01
  note "Probe LIFE-04: a running benefit raised by law mid-year; each month reads the amount in force."
  note "The award and the act are the card's stipulations, known from start (L 4.5). The act's row governs from 1 September and the award's row has no span, so the act's wins there (L 4.6 precedence 4)."

source card "Probe card LIFE-04 (tmp/cases/probes/life/LIFE-04.md): story, rule 1 and question"

index mo = month 2025-01..2025-12

input benefit: money DUK question "What is Halina's monthly benefit?"

def monthly[m in mo]: money DUK = benefit

ask total_2025: sum(m in mo: monthly[m])

version card_act
  cite card
  governs 2025-09-01..
  known 2025-01-01
  benefit = 1100 "story: an act raises running benefits to 1 100.00 from 1 September 2025"

version card_award
  cite card
  known 2025-01-01
  benefit = 1000 "story: Halina receives a benefit of 1 000.00 DUK a month through 2025"
